{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Release superseded records after dropping the lane lock.** Replacing `_pending` decrements the previous record while `_cond` is held. Supported transformed/non-JSON values may define `__del__`, so the checkpoint thread can run arbitrary blocking code here; a finalizer that re-enters this lane deadlocks on the non-reentrant lock. Retain the displaced record until after the `with` block, similarly defer pending cleanup in `_disable_locked`, and add a finalizer re-entry regression.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7tfUr0","finding_digest":"39c68c3da373b8aa1d2aa5d651404aa16dd3932353750b14839bfc8aa829f637","finding_id":"arf_v1_hhdiypndoo4kuhjkuxlfcqckuf","finding_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_exporterlane.schedule::pending-finalizer-under-lock","identity_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_exporterlane.schedule::pending-finalizer-under-lock","line":122,"observation_digest":"e3f1e794097009e08c98903d28251ab390b15882d0db8349e8160fc3a62d5d1f","observation_id":"aro_v1_4py6pfajoae6bdeysa6sqji2wo","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_insight/_export_scheduler.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-10T23:31:06Z","review_id":"arr_v1_7o5junual2x2e5ekjiaagtsrrc","reviewed_base_sha":"630b7771cedb1cf561e6ac29d49b84b6291db6b4","reviewed_head_sha":"afc10fe129032aa3f2496bcbea3af41b17fe11bd","reviewer":"codex","start_line":122,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":702},"record_id":"art_v1_hgbh3a3e2xhmdko3kkmgi47rs2","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-10T23:31:06Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
